  m_text: "<color=#FFD966><b>\uC0AC\uC6A9\uD55C Override</b></color>\n<b>\uBC24</b>  White Balance(Temperature -45)\n  Color Adjustments(Exposure -1.1, Filter \uD30C\uB791, Sat -25)\n  Lift Gamma Gain(Lift \uD30C\uB791)\n<b>\uB358\uC804</b>  Color Adjustments(Saturation -65, Contrast 30)\n  Shadows Midtones Highlights, Vignette 0.35\n<b>LUT</b>  Color Lookup: 1024x32 LUT (URP \uC5D0\uC14B LUT \uD06C\uAE30 32)\n  sRGB \uB044\uAE30, \uC555\uCD95 \uC5C6\uC74C, Mip \uC5C6\uC74C\uC73C\uB85C \uC784\uD3EC\uD2B8"
